% composition-context: Muddy Waters' Chicago blues recording connects Delta traditions, electrification, Black migration and the music industry. This original school blues uses a different riff and neutral words.
% composition-distance: Original melody, lyric and accompaniment; no stop-time riff, Willie Dixon lyric or recording arrangement is copied.
